- The Windows installers include a GPL-enabled FFmpeg build (libx264/libx265
  enabled, not LGPL-only). FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU GPL; the GPL text
  must be shipped with the installer.
- When redistributing an installer that contains this FFmpeg build, you must
  also make the corresponding FFmpeg source available, or provide a written
  offer valid for at least three years.
- FFmpeg source: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html
- FFmpeg license information: https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
- The application code remains Apache-2.0; FFmpeg is a separate program
  distributed alongside it (aggregation), not a derivative work.
